 LOADING THE EXPRESSION DESCRIBED BY FATTR INTO REGISTER X-FRP
 OR FOR STORING X-FRP AT LOCATION DESCRIBED BY FATTR (TAKING INTO
 ACCOUNT CDC 6000 HARDWARE FEATURES)*)
   VAR LRP, REG : SHRTINT; AT : ADDRESS;  BT : BOOLEAN;
BEGIN WITH FATTR DO
  IF TYPTR <> NIL THEN
